h2 Filtered list
p The requirements listed in the next section are applicable to the ICT based on the selections from the ICT Requirements Generator. The removed requirements are deemed to have been met as the ICT is not applicable to them based on their preconditions. The following selections were made when creating this document:
if question_list.length === 1
  ul
    li #{question_list[0].frName}
else if question_list.length > 0
  ul
    each item, i in question_list
      if i < question_list.length - 2
        li #{item.frName};
      else if i == question_list.length - 2
        li #{item.frName} et
      else
        li #{item.frName}
else
  p
    strong Aucune clause n'a été supprimée.